 rom 11/22 - 12/20 and for this gathering we'll discuss the Astrological ha
 ppenings of the zodiac season and where it will impact you personally (bir
 th chart recommended not required).\nAs with all energetic shifts\, gettin
 g into your body is important. Together we'll ground into the energy throu
 gh meditation and somatic movement themed around the season.\nAccommodatio
 ns/Modification will be made for ALL bodies\, come as you are.\nWe'll clos
