SUMMARY:New Moon Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nJoin us for a gathering to set new intentions and 
 connect with the energy of the new moon.\nMeet the New Moon in ceremony th
 rough astrology\, Akashic soul journeying\, ritual & embodied intention.\n
 Approaching the threshold of a new lunar cycle with intentionality is a po
 werful choice that becomes even more amplified when done in community.\n\n
 The New Moon offers a monthly portal to pause\, listen inward\, and consci
 ously seed what you desire to cultivate in the cycle ahead. Gathering in c
 eremony creates the space to step outside the momentum of everyday life an
 d meet that threshold with presence\, allowing your intentions to be witne
 ssed\, embodied\, and amplified within the collective.\n\nEach New Moon al
 so carries the unique energetic signature of the zodiac sign it moves thro
 ugh\, offering different themes and invitations for your growth. By workin
 g intentionally with the astrology of each lunation\, you can align your i
 ntentions with the energies already available to you and receive deeper cl
 arity around what is ready to begin.\n\nEach month\, we gather at the Soul
  Sanctuary beneath the dark moon sky for an evening of astrology\, soul jo
 urneying\, ritual\, and embodied intention.\n\n**This month with the Sagit
 tarius New Moon\, we invite you to lift your gaze toward a larger horizon 
 and reconnect with what makes you feel alive\, expansive\, and full of pos
 sibility.**\n\n**Together\, we’ll work with Sagittarius’ fiery medicin
 e to clarify the truth and vision guiding our next chapter\, strengthen ou
 r faith in where we’re being called\, and plant intentions that ask us t
 o move courageously toward it.**\n\n**What to Expect**\n\n* Guided drop-in
  meditation\n* Astrological teaching + transmission\n* Guided Akashic soul
  journey\n* Reflection + intention setting\n* Ceremonial fire offerings\n*
  Closing embodiment + integration\n* Sacred space for connection and commu
 nity\n\nNo prior experience with astrology\, meditation\, or ceremonial pr
 actice is necessary. Simply come as you are.\n\n**About Your Facilitators*
 *\nAlessandra Mary is a trained priestess\, ceremonialist\, and Akashic gu
 ide devoted to creating spaces where the sacred becomes something you can 
 experience\, embody\, and weave into everyday life.\n\nJenn is a witch of 
 the cosmos and astrologer who brings the language of the stars down to ear
 th\, illuminating the energetic patterns and possibilities available withi
 n each lunar cycle.\n\nTogether\, Alessandra and Jenn weave the mystical a
 nd the embodied\, the cosmic and the ceremonial\, creating a space where y
 ou can not only understand the energy of the New Moon\, but more important
 ly\, experience it.\n\n**What to Bring**\nOur ceremony will primarily take
  place outside on the grass around the fire\, with a large covered porch a
 vailable as our rain plan. Please dress with the evening weather in mind.\
 n\n**Be sure to bring:**\n\n* Water bottle\n* Journal + pen\n* Comfortable
  clothing and layers appropriate for the weather\n* Any sacred objects\, c
 rystals\, talismans\, or other items you would like to place on our collec
 tive altar and charge during the ceremony\n\nLawn blankets and meditation 
 cushions will be provided\, though you are very welcome to bring your own 
 blanket\, cushion\, or camping chair if you’d prefer.\n\nCome ready to s
 low down\, listen deeply\, sit beneath the dark moon\, and lean into what 
 is waiting to begin.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE: Pre-registration is required for th
 is event to honor the capacity of the space.** If you would like to skip t
 he eventbrite fees\, you can Venmo us $30 [here](https://venmo.com/u/iamal
 essandramary "https://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary"):
